# Cloudflare Workers static assets headers. Only security headers: every
# asset keeps the Workers default cache (revalidate with the ETag), so a
# changed bundle, font, logo or SDF is never served stale next to fresh HTML.
# No Content-Security-Policy: see README "Deployment".

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
